WEBVTT

02:35.228 --> 02:37.363
Is this Zaza, the city on the sea?

02:37.363 --> 02:39.763
Where's the party?
Where are all the women?

02:40.099 --> 02:42.101
I can't see anything
through this fog.

02:42.101 --> 02:44.569
I thought we were on the right
train to go to Zaza, but...

02:44.971 --> 02:46.962
Is this all some kind of
weird dream? It can't be.

02:48.307 --> 02:52.539
If this were a dream, there would be
a party with women everywhere.

02:53.112 --> 02:55.706
It looks like we somehow got on
the wrong train or something.

02:56.816 --> 02:58.340
So where are we?

03:01.721 --> 03:06.420
Lullaby of the Por Vora

03:07.793 --> 03:09.454
Hey, it's about time you
filled me in, Jing.

03:09.729 --> 03:10.563
About?

03:10.563 --> 03:11.230
You know what, the treasure. What
treasure have we come here to get?
About?

03:11.230 --> 03:15.901
You know what, the treasure. What
treasure have we come here to get?

03:15.901 --> 03:19.132
Come on, hurry up and tell me!
Let's hear it already!

03:19.672 --> 03:21.902
Kir, to tell you the truth...

03:22.642 --> 03:24.810
You finally feel like telling me?

03:24.810 --> 03:26.277
What is it?

03:29.015 --> 03:30.482
We're lost.

03:31.083 --> 03:32.118
Do you have any idea where we are?

03:32.118 --> 03:32.585
What did you say?
Do you have any idea where we are?

03:32.585 --> 03:33.574
What did you say?

03:35.655 --> 03:37.179
This mist is weird,
don't you think?

03:37.623 --> 03:40.456
We're lost, everything
is going to look weird!

03:49.268 --> 03:50.770
Hey, we can at least eat
some of this chocolate

03:50.770 --> 03:52.260
to get our blood sugar levels up a bit.

03:55.775 --> 03:57.436
What's this?! What's going on?!

03:59.412 --> 04:00.279
Por Vora?!

04:00.279 --> 04:00.913
Get away from me!
Don't come any closer!
Por Vora?!

04:00.913 --> 04:02.348
Get away from me!
Don't come any closer!

04:02.348 --> 04:03.940
They could explode at any minute!

04:12.325 --> 04:13.792
Here you go.

05:48.888 --> 05:52.191
Where in the world are they taking us?

05:52.191 --> 05:54.853
I'm not sure, maybe they plan
on experimenting on us.

05:55.094 --> 05:56.561
What?!

06:13.112 --> 06:14.579
Welcome home.

06:16.081 --> 06:18.050
I'm home, honey!

06:18.050 --> 06:20.319
We must have met before
in a previous life.

06:20.319 --> 06:23.956
It must be destiny that has
brought us together again.

06:23.956 --> 06:25.787
We shouldn't fight the fate
that brought us together.

06:26.058 --> 06:29.050
There now, my darlings. Come
eat some more chocolate.

06:29.862 --> 06:31.329
There's plenty for everyone.

06:32.631 --> 06:34.121
I guess you don't remember.

06:34.366 --> 06:37.736
Hey, Jing, don't you think we've
met her before somewhere?

06:37.736 --> 06:39.761
Speaking of places,
where are we now?

07:01.227 --> 07:04.060
There are so many Por Vora here!
What are they all doing?

07:04.830 --> 07:06.422
I think I've heard about this place.

07:07.032 --> 07:11.025
Long ago, all of the Por Vora were
born in a place called Bluwari.

07:11.871 --> 07:15.204
Bluwari? I don't know about that, but
this place looks like some factory.

07:15.841 --> 07:18.969
Maybe they manufacture these
guys as toys or something?

07:20.513 --> 07:23.243
They're a little too dangerous
to be toys if you ask me.

07:27.253 --> 07:29.244
I've never seen a Vora become
so attached to anyone before.

07:31.457 --> 07:34.392
Are you guys on vacation? Feel free
to stay here as long as you like.

07:34.660 --> 07:37.151
I'm sorry, but we are in
somewhat of a hurry.

07:37.563 --> 07:39.155
We can't afford to hang
around for long.

07:40.833 --> 07:42.801
She's telling me that she wants
you to stick around longer.

07:44.803 --> 07:46.270
Hey...

07:56.148 --> 07:58.275
We're not here so you idiots
can eat chocolate all day!

07:58.517 --> 08:00.144
Don't complain to me
when you get sick!

08:13.999 --> 08:16.092
So this is the secret Bluwari.

08:16.468 --> 08:19.301
I feel like we've just found the house
made of candy in the forest.

08:19.638 --> 08:22.505
Well then, let's get on with it.

08:27.246 --> 08:30.545
Why are you guys flocking
to me like this to play?

08:34.219 --> 08:38.087
Hey, guys! Quit playing like
that or you could explode!

08:39.825 --> 08:41.292
So big!

08:57.710 --> 09:00.178
Okay, everyone, nap time.

09:07.086 --> 09:09.714
I'll read you all a book before
you take your naps.

09:10.489 --> 09:13.559
Once you're asleep, I'll
sing you a lullaby

09:13.559 --> 09:15.584
to ensure that you all rest well.

09:43.822 --> 09:45.591
What kind of dance is this?

09:45.591 --> 09:47.559
I think they're trying to welcome us.

09:51.530 --> 09:53.395
They're risking their lives to
make us feel at home.

09:53.932 --> 09:57.836
Okay, first we will stop the white
smoke of the poppo train.

09:57.836 --> 10:00.105
Then we will close the eyelids
of the great red eyes,

10:00.105 --> 10:02.941
climb the magic tower, and if you
guys can work your magic,

10:02.941 --> 10:06.707
everything should open
right up for us.

10:07.446 --> 10:10.381
Then we shall steal the root behind
the explosive Por Vora creatures.

10:11.016 --> 10:14.008
Once we have their secret, no
one will be able to stop us!

10:14.420 --> 10:16.479
We will rule everything!

10:46.852 --> 10:49.082
That door must never be opened.

10:49.822 --> 10:51.756
No one may ever enter the
room that lies behind it.

10:52.091 --> 10:53.752
Okay, let's go back.

10:58.864 --> 11:00.354
What? For me?

11:05.003 --> 11:06.470
Whoa, there.

12:04.062 --> 12:05.529
Thanks.

12:14.339 --> 12:16.705
Ready? Let's get on our way!

12:36.228 --> 12:37.695
Goodnight.

12:40.566 --> 12:43.535
I want to thank you for playing
with the little Vora.

12:50.843 --> 12:54.176
Don't mention it. Those guys are so
cute that they're hard to resist.

12:55.714 --> 12:57.783
On another note, where was
it again that we first met?

12:57.783 --> 12:59.518
I can't quite place it. It is our
fate to be together,

12:59.518 --> 13:01.954
there's no fighting it, baby.

13:01.954 --> 13:04.445
There's a bright future out
there for the two of us!

13:05.157 --> 13:06.892
Will you please stay
here forever then?

13:06.892 --> 13:09.328
Does that mean that
we'll be married?!

13:09.328 --> 13:11.796
Hey, Jing, did she just
propose to me?

13:12.097 --> 13:14.531
Please stay here with me forever.

13:14.833 --> 13:16.300
Yes!

13:19.671 --> 13:22.504
I'm so glad. You know
this is a secret location.

13:22.841 --> 13:24.934
You must not tell anyone about it.

13:25.577 --> 13:27.875
That is why I need you
two to stay here forever.

13:28.347 --> 13:30.713
Okay, no problem, it'll
be our little secret.

13:31.250 --> 13:33.514
Together we can protect
the Vora forever.

13:34.186 --> 13:36.245
I'll do anything for you, baby.

13:38.156 --> 13:39.521
You guys are so nice.

13:39.925 --> 13:42.325
You're so different from the
evil visitors I sometimes get.

13:42.761 --> 13:45.059
The evil visitors you sometimes get?

13:45.998 --> 13:48.831
Sometimes the little ones are
followed on their way here,

13:49.334 --> 13:50.801
and I must protect them.

13:51.303 --> 13:52.804
I will protect them for you!

13:52.804 --> 13:55.773
No matter who comes our way, I will
protect you against all enemies!

13:56.041 --> 13:57.508
Enemies...

14:06.184 --> 14:09.779
They are so important. They mustn't
fall into the wrong hands.

14:10.856 --> 14:12.653
Don't worry, you will never
fall into the wrong hands.

14:12.891 --> 14:14.859
My hands will always
watch over you.

14:31.209 --> 14:33.404
We've stopped the white
smoke of the poppo train.

14:34.012 --> 14:36.344
All right, let's get going,
Sweet and Bitter!

14:42.988 --> 14:45.023
What is it? A fire?

14:45.023 --> 14:46.490
This is...

14:47.025 --> 14:48.492
They've destroyed the equipment
that made the mist!

14:53.231 --> 14:55.062
What's wrong, Elixir?

14:55.567 --> 14:56.601
Intruders...

14:56.601 --> 14:57.069
Intruders?
Intruders...

14:57.069 --> 14:57.703
Intruders?

14:57.703 --> 14:58.103
Intruders?
It seems this is one of those times
when you've got evil visitors.

14:58.103 --> 15:01.129
It seems this is one of those times
when you've got evil visitors.

15:30.702 --> 15:33.905
Okay, we've got to shut those
red eyes so we can get through.

15:33.905 --> 15:35.372
Sweet and Bitter!

15:37.943 --> 15:39.410
What's taking so long?

15:45.384 --> 15:46.874
All right, let's go!

15:47.386 --> 15:50.219
This system is so old
it's a joke. Too easy!

16:10.809 --> 16:14.370
Go ahead of me and start working
your magic, Sweet and Bitter!

16:18.617 --> 16:20.608
For an old lady, you're not too wise.

16:21.820 --> 16:23.321
If just one of the Por Vora is set off,

16:23.321 --> 16:26.119
it could start a chain reaction
and blow up the whole place.

16:45.143 --> 16:46.812
Take this!

16:46.812 --> 16:50.771
What a loud old lady. She's going
to wake up the little ones.

16:54.052 --> 16:58.824
After I press this last key there
will be nothing to stop us!

16:58.824 --> 17:00.621
No! That door mustn't be opened!

17:12.204 --> 17:16.140
All right, their security system
is now completely useless.

17:28.687 --> 17:29.754
What is this?

17:29.754 --> 17:30.188
I'd back off if I were you.
What is this?

17:30.188 --> 17:31.553
I'd back off if I were you.

17:48.373 --> 17:50.568
The final phase of the security
system is now launching.

17:51.643 --> 17:54.168
Sweet and Bitter, didn't you take
care of the entire system?

17:54.746 --> 17:56.111
Please evacuate immediately.

17:57.449 --> 18:01.086
Damn, it's a self-destruct
mechanism, Mom!

18:01.086 --> 18:03.288
What did you say?!
Why a self-destruct?

18:03.288 --> 18:04.755
Run!

18:21.006 --> 18:22.473
Elixir?!

18:27.445 --> 18:29.709
Now I understand.
The true enemy is...

18:29.948 --> 18:32.382
Enemy? They already ran away!?

18:32.951 --> 18:35.620
In accordance with Article 435

18:35.620 --> 18:37.611
of the Safety Protection
Secrecy Regulations,

18:37.889 --> 18:40.119
I will continue the process to
destroy Por Vora Bluwari.

18:40.458 --> 18:43.621
Hold on a second! You plan on
blowing up all the Por Vora?!

18:43.995 --> 18:46.054
The self-destruct process
has already begun.

18:46.298 --> 18:48.528
I will continue the process
to destroy Por Vora Bluwari.

18:49.534 --> 18:51.934
No! She changed! This
can't be the same Elixir!

18:52.370 --> 18:55.640
Jing! I thought she was supposed to
be trying to protect the Por Vora,

18:55.640 --> 18:57.042
not blow them up!

18:57.042 --> 19:00.011
The Por Vora themselves
must protect their secret.

19:00.545 --> 19:02.581
That is how they were born.

19:02.581 --> 19:04.742
They never should have been
released to the outside world.

19:05.417 --> 19:06.818
This self destruct mechanism
and Elixir's reactions

19:06.818 --> 19:08.285
are all for the same purpose,
to protect them.

19:08.753 --> 19:11.153
They must always be protected.

19:11.823 --> 19:14.792
They must always stay safe.
This must always remain secret.

19:15.594 --> 19:17.862
But I thought that was her job?!

19:17.862 --> 19:21.366
They would have never
have wanted this!

19:21.366 --> 19:23.095
I don't get it!

19:23.602 --> 19:25.069
She was so nice!

19:25.403 --> 19:28.201
She promised to protect the Por
Vora from all their enemies!

19:29.874 --> 19:32.035
But the true enemy of
the Por Vora is...

19:32.510 --> 19:34.980
Mom, my nose won't stop bleeding!

19:34.980 --> 19:36.504
I'd worry about stopping
this thing first!

19:50.595 --> 19:52.995
A Super Por Vora?!

19:55.033 --> 19:56.591
Super Por Vora?

19:57.035 --> 19:59.902
Only one special Por Vora was made,
and its destructive power must be

20:00.338 --> 20:03.705
a hundred times more powerful
than that of a normal Por Vora.

20:04.342 --> 20:07.573
I wish we could just back up and
forget anything ever happened.

20:09.180 --> 20:10.548
What are we going to do, Jing?!

20:10.548 --> 20:12.817
We're right in the middle of everything!

20:12.817 --> 20:14.375
We have no time left to run.

20:14.619 --> 20:16.588
We must somehow stop
her from exploding.

20:16.588 --> 20:20.615
But we only have thirty seconds left!
How do we stop it?!

20:20.959 --> 20:22.426
Calm down, Kir.

20:22.661 --> 20:25.152
The slightest vibration could
set off the explosion.

20:25.964 --> 20:29.422
Of the five cords, only one of
them is the real detonator.

20:29.701 --> 20:33.728
But if we cut one of the dummy
cords, we'll set it off.

20:37.309 --> 20:38.776
Jing!

20:39.644 --> 20:40.979
I guess I'll just have to steal it!

20:40.979 --> 20:43.140
Steal the fate that this guy
will share with the Por Vora.

21:04.436 --> 21:06.063
Kir Royale!

21:15.113 --> 21:17.081
This way, no one will ever
be able to bother them.

21:17.916 --> 21:21.477
I was almost positive that I had
met her before somewhere.

21:24.522 --> 21:26.456
Your alarm clock has been turned off.

21:27.726 --> 21:29.216
Now you can finally sleep in peace.
